# Spike build output.
#
# The spike is throwaway work on its own branch, but it is still a .NET project, and bin/obj from a
# 147 MB self-contained Linux publish would otherwise be very easy to commit by accident with `git add
# -A`. Binaries in git are unrecoverable and slow to notice.
bin/
obj/

# Uno template extras that are per-machine, not per-project.
.vs/
*.user
